OL,3,GNEWSAWhy Scottish football is
OL,4,Astruggling to produce young talent
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalum Ferguson achieved what thousands
OL,7,Fof young footballers dream of when he
OL,8,Fplayed for his boyhood club, Inverness
OL,9,FCaledonian Thistle, in the Scottish
OL,10,FPremiership.
OL,12,FYet the 31-year-old looks back on his
OL,13,Fcareer as proof of a difficult truth
OL,14,Fabout youth development in Scotland.
OL,16,FFerguson graduated from Caley Thistle's
OL,17,Facademy at 18 but played just two games
OL,18,Ffor the first team before moving to
OL,19,Flower league clubs and then to Canada
OL,20,Fand New Zealand to try to get
OL,21,Ftop-flight football.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
