OL,3,GNEWSAWhy Scottish football is
OL,4,Astruggling to produce young talent
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow a development officer with Alba
OL,7,FFootball Alliance, he believes Scottish
OL,8,Ffootball continues to sell young
OL,9,Fplayers and their families the promise
OL,10,Fof a pathway from the academies to the
OL,11,Ffirst team, which for most will never
OL,12,Fbe a reality.
